    "description": "纯 Dart Flutter 图像组件：圆形/圆角裁剪、外边框、内边框与遮罩叠加效果，全部基于 CustomPainter/Canvas 渲染，零原生代码，全平台可用。",
    "adaptation_approach": "将 Android NiceImageView.java 的 Canvas 绘制逻辑逐像素移植为纯 Dart Flutter Widget（CustomPaint + CustomPainter）。用 canvas.clipPath() 替代 Android PorterDuff 混合模式（DST_IN/DST_OUT）与 Path.Op.DIFFERENCE 差集；用 Path.addOval/Path.addRRect 构造圆形/圆角路径；canvas.save()/clipPath()/restore() 替代 saveLayer；translate+scale+translate 替代 Canvas.scale(sx,sy,px,py)；CustomPainter.shouldRepaint() 替代 View.invalidate()。零原生代码、零平台分支，无需 ohos/ HAR。",
    "plugin_version": "1.0.5"
  },
